WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
The price of this drawing has definitely skyrocketed

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:02,920
Even if we can't use it

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:06,000
You can gain a lot of wisdom by blocking your hand

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,640
First use the reason that it is too expensive and cannot be used to severely lower the price.

5
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,600
Don't buy too expensive

6
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,970
Leave it to me

7
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:13,410
Classmate Chen An

8
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:18,940
How are we going to sleep with that me tonight?

9
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,700
Can I sleep on the recliner?

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,980
Classmate Lin Luxi

11
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,100
you are engineering

12
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,580
I can make room for you on the bed without me

13
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,300
I can just sleep on the recliner.

14
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,540
Since you want to sleep on the recliner

15
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,450
Then the deck chair is yours tonight

16
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:31,730
Thank you, classmate Chen An

17
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:33,370
Obviously I have to deal with a lot

18
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:34,610
Why does Chen An treat me like that?

19
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:37,210
I'm not that kind to him.

20
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:38,610
You'll finish eating later

21
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:40,210
Remember to wash the plates and bowls

22
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,610
Use a bucket of water at the foot of the wall

23
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:42,610
If you can't wash it in time

24
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:43,970
Just don't go to bed

25
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:45,090
Don't eat tomorrow either

26
00:00:45,090 --> 00:00:47,020
I still have to wash the dishes.

27
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,620
If you can't find me, eat quickly.
